-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains no vendored third-party source. It links to the DAOS
client libraries (libdaos, libdfs) through ctypes at run time and plugs into
LMCache through its documented extension points; neither is redistributed here.

The directory `gpudirect/patches/` holds patches -- unified diffs -- against
four upstream projects. A diff necessarily quotes context lines from the file
it patches, so those fragments remain under the license of the project they
come from, not under this repository's license:

    DAOS        BSD-2-Clause-Patent      https://github.com/daos-stack/daos
    UCX         BSD-3-Clause             https://github.com/openucx/ucx
    Mercury     BSD-3-Clause             https://github.com/mercury-hpc/mercury
    libfabric   BSD-2-Clause OR GPL-2.0  https://github.com/ofiwg/libfabric

The changes introduced by those patches (the added lines) are contributed by
Gluesys under the license of the project they target, so that they can be
submitted upstream without further permission. Submission drafts are kept in
`doc/upstream/`.

`doc/upstream/lmcache-async-serializer-option.md` quotes short excerpts of
LMCache (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache) for the purpose of
describing a proposed change to it.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Interoperating projects
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This software is designed to run with, but does not include or modify:

    LMCache     Apache-2.0
    vLLM        Apache-2.0
    DAOS        BSD-2-Clause-Patent

Names of those projects are used only to identify the software this backend
interoperates with.
